The research team intends to lower the[ integral] costs of PV-modules, by developing a worldwide unique[ AAA]-class In-Line steady state solar simulator (ILSS)[ prototype] for the PV-[indust]ry that is validated on criteria for test speed (5 modules/minute), test accuracy, heat development, maintenance and lamp[ replacement] costs.
Why do we need an automated test-measurement system for Solar modules? PV-module manufacturers require automated inline testing[ equipment] that provide accurate information about PV-module performance with industrial robustness and low testing cost per module.

